mapping "X8699.1" source="X8699" target="269732008" relationship=equivalent {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        curated re-elevation (exact_match): Source X8699 = SE extension of WHO X86 SNOMED CT 269732008 +
        place (unspecified) + activity (unspecified). Verified Maps-to 45756454 (X86) -> 4155225
        (269732008, standard S). The qualifier in the SNOMED CT name disambiguates the
        contact/chemical-burn mechanism (X86) from the poisoning mechanism (X85), mirroring ICD-10'.
        """
}
